WEBVTT

00:02:59.934 --> 00:03:02.392
works out to be that same fixed value

00:03:02.392 --> 00:03:04.177
that we know everyone measures.

00:03:04.177 --> 00:03:05.403
On the other hand,

00:03:05.403 --> 00:03:06.929
something strange has happened.

00:03:06.929 --> 00:03:10.873
The fence posts aren't spaced a meter apart anymore,

00:03:10.873 --> 00:03:12.384
and my mom will be worried

00:03:12.384 --> 00:03:14.520
that I look a bit thin.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:17.791
But that's not fair. Why don't I get to look thin?

00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:19.834
I thought physics was supposed to be the same

00:03:19.834 --> 00:03:20.937
for everyone.

00:03:20.937 --> 00:03:23.052
Yes, no, it is, and you do.

00:03:23.052 --> 00:03:24.862
All that stretching and squashing

00:03:24.862 --> 00:03:26.841
of space-time has just muddled together

00:03:26.841 --> 00:03:28.977
what we used to think of separately

00:03:28.977 --> 00:03:30.791
as space and time.